WEBVTT

00:00:03.442 --> 00:00:07.490
Uh, nice magic marble.
Real scary.

00:00:10.711 --> 00:00:12.713
[yelps] That actually
is real scary!

00:00:14.802 --> 00:00:16.281
It's a mini black hole!

00:00:16.455 --> 00:00:18.806
It's going to suck in
all the matter in this base!

00:00:22.374 --> 00:00:23.898
[all yelling]

00:00:24.072 --> 00:00:25.987
Fear not, friends.

00:00:26.683 --> 00:00:28.555
Even my teeth are muscles!

00:00:29.207 --> 00:00:30.165
[Sonic yelps]

00:00:30.339 --> 00:00:31.862
[Knuckles growls]

00:00:34.125 --> 00:00:36.606
Sonic, try to reach
one of my rings!

00:00:36.780 --> 00:00:37.999
[Sonic] Got one.

00:00:38.173 --> 00:00:40.392
Check this out. Trick shot!

00:00:40.567 --> 00:00:41.785
[grunts]

00:00:44.092 --> 00:00:45.572
Come on.

00:00:46.834 --> 00:00:48.400
Come on.

00:00:48.575 --> 00:00:50.228
Come on.[Knuckles groans]

00:00:51.839 --> 00:00:53.536
[both] Come on!

00:00:54.276 --> 00:00:55.190
[yells]

00:00:55.364 --> 00:00:57.540
[all yelling]

00:01:02.937 --> 00:01:05.461
Yeah! Yes!

00:01:09.160 --> 00:01:10.161
[Sonic] Yikes.

00:01:11.467 --> 00:01:13.251
Somebody better call
Google Maps.

00:01:14.426 --> 00:01:16.994
[rumbling faintly]

00:01:17.168 --> 00:01:21.303
I've spent years
trying to cleanse
the cosmos

00:01:21.477 --> 00:01:25.133
of that spiny,
blue speed freak.

00:01:25.307 --> 00:01:26.961
And you did it...

00:01:28.484 --> 00:01:30.312
in one afternoon.

00:01:30.486 --> 00:01:34.403
There's nothing
we can't destroy
together, my boy.

00:01:34.577 --> 00:01:37.449
Charting route to GUN
Headquarters in London, sirs.

00:01:37.624 --> 00:01:39.713
ETA four hours.

00:01:39.887 --> 00:01:41.192
As the crab flies.

00:01:41.366 --> 00:01:43.717
By all accounts,
we're ahead of schedule.

00:01:44.674 --> 00:01:46.589
We should take this time

00:01:46.763 --> 00:01:48.765
to get to know
each other better.

00:01:48.939 --> 00:01:50.680
Wow. What?

00:01:51.420 --> 00:01:52.508
You mean...

00:01:52.682 --> 00:01:55.946
spend some
qua-qua-quality time?

00:01:56.120 --> 00:02:00.864
You've waited for this
your whole life.

00:02:01.038 --> 00:02:07.349
How would you choose
to spend one perfect day
with your new grand pal?

00:02:19.187 --> 00:02:20.492
[elbow thuds][grunts]

00:02:21.406 --> 00:02:22.930
[both screaming]

00:02:23.104 --> 00:02:24.932
["Wouldn't It Be Nice"
by the Beach Boys playing]

00:02:25.672 --> 00:02:26.977
[bell dinging]

00:02:30.415 --> 00:02:31.199
[yelps]

00:02:31.373 --> 00:02:32.330
[wincing groan]

00:02:51.610 --> 00:02:52.568
[shrieks happily]

00:03:01.229 --> 00:03:04.536
Ooh! [chortling]

00:03:04.711 --> 00:03:07.452
[rockets whistle and explode]

00:03:18.768 --> 00:03:20.552
[song fades out]

00:03:22.250 --> 00:03:25.253
[song resumes]

00:03:32.347 --> 00:03:33.827
[song ends]

00:03:43.358 --> 00:03:44.794
And done!

00:03:44.968 --> 00:03:47.710
Masterpiece.
- Look at that.
- Yay!

00:03:47.884 --> 00:03:51.322
It's really been great
having time to ourselves.

00:03:51.496 --> 00:03:53.934
Right. Absolutely.
I just feel so...

00:03:54.108 --> 00:03:55.500
relaxed, you know?
Clearheaded.

00:03:55.674 --> 00:03:57.981
Mmm, look at all these
new interests we found.

00:03:58.155 --> 00:04:00.157
- I know, so many hobbies.
- So many!

00:04:00.331 --> 00:04:03.160
After the action and adventure
of the last few years,

00:04:03.334 --> 00:04:05.554
- well, I could get used to this.
- Same.

00:04:05.728 --> 00:04:07.730
[deep rumbling]

00:04:11.299 --> 00:04:13.649
[Sonic] Tom! Maddie!
We need your help on a super--

00:04:13.823 --> 00:04:16.652
- Knuckles, do you mind?
- Oh! Excuse me.

00:04:16.826 --> 00:04:18.262
Tom! Maddie! We need your help

00:04:18.436 --> 00:04:19.960
on a super-dangerous
top-secret mission!

00:04:20.134 --> 00:04:21.178
Hmm.

00:04:22.919 --> 00:04:24.573
- Thank God. Yeah, we're in.
- Let's go.

00:04:24.747 --> 00:04:26.967
Really? You're in?
Just like that?

00:04:27.141 --> 00:04:29.883
Yes. It was getting so boring
- without you guys here.
- Yeah. So...

00:04:30.057 --> 00:04:31.710
No offense....boring. No, none taken.

00:04:31.885 --> 00:04:33.364
I mean, whatever crazy plan
you're cooking up,

00:04:33.538 --> 00:04:34.844
- the answer's yes.
- Yes.

00:04:35.018 --> 00:04:37.978
Great. But first things first:
What is that?

00:04:38.152 --> 00:04:39.631
Oh! This is...

00:04:39.806 --> 00:04:41.242
[in puppet voice]
...Li'l Tom!

00:04:41.416 --> 00:04:42.896
[normal voice]
Isn't he great?

00:04:44.462 --> 00:04:46.682
I told you
to get rid of that.
It's very creepy.

00:04:46.856 --> 00:04:48.031
[puppet voice]
I told him to get rid of you.

00:04:48.205 --> 00:04:49.598
[normal voice]
Okay, that's, mmm...

00:04:49.772 --> 00:04:51.992
- crossing a line there.
- You are in so much trouble.

00:04:54.081 --> 00:04:56.823
Okay, this is it.
The belly of the beast.

00:04:56.997 --> 00:04:59.260
GUN Headquarters in London.

00:04:59.434 --> 00:05:02.393
[gasps] Tom, we're finally gonna
get to see London together.

00:05:02.567 --> 00:05:04.526
Hey, I told you we'd
get there someday, baby.

00:05:04.700 --> 00:05:06.397
Okay. So here's the plan.

00:05:06.571 --> 00:05:08.617
<i>I run in superfast,</i>

00:05:08.791 --> 00:05:10.749
<i>fly over that water,
no problem,</i>

00:05:10.924 --> 00:05:12.229
<i>and right when I get to the--</i>

00:05:13.622 --> 00:05:15.276
[shrieks]
What just happened?

00:05:15.450 --> 00:05:16.799
Congratulations.

00:05:16.973 --> 00:05:18.975
You just got incinerated
by their energy shield.

00:05:19.149 --> 00:05:22.761
We'll need to shut it down
by planting a USB drive
in their server room

00:05:22.936 --> 00:05:25.155
<i>that will give me full control
over it.</i>

00:05:25.329 --> 00:05:26.940
That's what we need you two for.

00:05:27.114 --> 00:05:28.811
Couple of badass spies,
that's what we are.

00:05:28.985 --> 00:05:30.508
Mr. and Mrs. Smith.

00:05:30.682 --> 00:05:32.336
[Tails] <i>Once we
disable the shield,</i>

00:05:32.510 --> 00:05:34.338
<i>you'll face the laser hall.</i>

00:05:34.512 --> 00:05:36.123
[grunts]

00:05:36.297 --> 00:05:39.561
<i>These high-density bad boys
will cut you into tiny pieces.</i>

00:05:41.041 --> 00:05:43.565
<i>And cut those pieces
into even tinier pieces!</i>

00:05:43.739 --> 00:05:45.828
Once again... [shrieks]

00:05:46.002 --> 00:05:48.222
Can't we just get Tom Cruise
to do this?[Tails] Nope.

00:05:48.396 --> 00:05:52.008
<i>Because not even he
could break into... the vault.</i>

00:05:52.182 --> 00:05:53.618
[Sonic]
<i>Why is it empty in there?</i>

00:05:53.792 --> 00:05:55.229
[Tails]
<i>Because we have no idea</i>

00:05:55.403 --> 00:05:56.883
<i>what's on the other side
of that door.</i>

00:05:57.057 --> 00:05:59.537
<i>To prevent the vault from ever
being accessed by a ring,</i>

00:05:59.711 --> 00:06:02.671
<i>all images and schematics have
been wiped from GUN's database.</i>

00:06:02.845 --> 00:06:04.891
So for the last leg
of this heist...

00:06:06.153 --> 00:06:08.111
[in puppet voice]
...we're going in blind.

00:06:12.811 --> 00:06:14.030
Sorry.

00:06:14.204 --> 00:06:15.727
[Maddie] Okay,
I'm just gonna say it.

00:06:15.902 --> 00:06:18.295
It sounds like this plan would
work a heck of a lot better

00:06:18.469 --> 00:06:21.995
if Sonic used the Master Emerald
to go Golden God mode

00:06:22.169 --> 00:06:23.387
to get the key.

00:06:24.475 --> 00:06:25.999
No way, Maddie.

00:06:26.173 --> 00:06:28.131
The Master Emerald
is too powerful
to ever use again.

00:06:28.305 --> 00:06:30.612
We made a promise to each other
to keep it hidden.

00:06:30.786 --> 00:06:32.919
In a location
only Knuckles knows.

00:06:33.093 --> 00:06:35.269
As guardian
of the Master Emerald,

00:06:35.443 --> 00:06:38.315
anyone who tries
to take it away
for any reason...

00:06:38.489 --> 00:06:40.796
will become a sworn enemy.

00:06:40.970 --> 00:06:42.711
Okay, okay! Sheesh!

00:06:42.885 --> 00:06:44.495
No need to get
all growly on me, buddy.

00:06:44.669 --> 00:06:47.803
You guys are always telling us
to make good choices.

00:06:47.977 --> 00:06:49.718
Well, this is the right choice.

00:06:49.892 --> 00:06:51.459
Okay.

00:06:51.633 --> 00:06:53.940
I guess
we're going to...

00:06:54.114 --> 00:06:57.552
["London Town"
by Mr Eazi playing]

